\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: .05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-b9bc0b783831740dEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-7a5ba858147fbe1aEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_StormshoreTabernacle_VicarPrayerDraft</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_StormshoreTabernacle_VicarPrayerDraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_StormshoreTabernacle_VicarPrayerDraft\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">af63faa5-c058-4a75-83a4-47cfb0ed39eb</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:af63faa5-c058-4a75-83a4-47cfb0ed39eb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:af63faa5-c058-4a75-83a4-47cfb0ed39eb\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stormshore_Tabernacle\" title=\"Stormshore Tabernacle\">Stormshore Tabernacle</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;118&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-16</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[An in-progress draft of a new prayer to cast across the entire pantheon. It bears the heavy marks of repeated revision.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\nO, ye gathered <a href=\"/wiki/Deities\" title=\"Deities\">gods</a>! <i>(no, too exclamatory)</i>\n</p><p><br>\nHear my prayer, cast wide, O resplendent pantheon. <i>(oh yes, much better)</i>\n</p><p><br>\nI offer it among the multitude for a reason: there cannot be true peace without godly accord. This city, this land, is besieged, under threat by a force that stakes a heretical claim to your divinity - each and every one of you.\n</p><p><br>\nHistory may well be marked by the clashes and bickerings of godly folk, but there is one fact upon which you all must agree (yes, even you, <a href=\"/wiki/Talos\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Talos\">Talos</a>): divinity is earned, not simply claimed.\n</p><p><br>\nWhile heretics stalk this world and threaten your faithful, please, broker even a mote of peace between yourselves. We need everything we can get.\n</p><p><br>\nIn all gathered faiths - hear our prayer.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715161652\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1334/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26741/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8710/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931301/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.818      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   39.818      1 -total\n 49.79%   19.825      6 Template:Icon_text\n 44.40%   17.681     15 Template:Trim\n 24.70%    9.833      2 Template:Uid\n 16.19%    6.447      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.08%    5.605      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.20%    4.061      1 Template:Notes\n  9.75%    3.882      1 Template:PageSeo\n  9.54%    3.797      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31453-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715161652 and revision id 402853. Rendering was triggered because: edit-page\n -->\n</div>"}